@host = http://localhost:8080
# Local dev (dotnet watch): @host = http://localhost:5073
@token = paste-an-admin-access-token
@gatewayToken = paste-a-gateway-access-token

### Create a site (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"siteId":"cittadella-catania","name":"Cittadella Universitaria","timeZone":"Europe/Rome","navigation":{"walkingSpeedMps":1.3,"unpavedSpeedFactor":0.8,"stepsSpeedFactor":0.5,"connectToleranceM":0.5,"maxSnapDistanceM":30}}

### List the sites of the tenant (Admin), sorted by siteId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read a site
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a site (Admin); If-Match = the ETag from the create or the read
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{"siteId":"cittadella-catania","name":"Cittadella Universitaria (updated)","timeZone":"Europe/Rome","navigation":{"walkingSpeedMps":1.3,"unpavedSpeedFactor":0.8,"stepsSpeedFactor":0.5,"connectToleranceM":0.5,"maxSnapDistanceM":30}}

### Read the map back (any role; ETag = map version)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/map
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload or replace the map (Admin, GeoJSON body)
# If-Match optional: send the ETag to avoid overwriting a newer map
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/map
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/geo+json

< ../../data/map.geojson

### Set the simulated clock (test mode on, Admin); frozen until the next PUT (Q38)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/test/clock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nowMs":1793268000000}

### Register a device on a site (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceId":"dev-001"}

### List the devices of a site (Admin), sorted by deviceId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read a device (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/devices/dev-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a device (Admin); If-Match = the ETag from the register or the read
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/devices/dev-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "1"

### Send a position batch (gateway client token, scope positions:write); a resend stores nothing twice
POST {{host}}/api/v1/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceId":"dev-001","positions":[{"timestampMs":1793268000000,"lat":37.5250,"lon":15.0710,"accuracyM":4.5}]}

### Occupancy per area of a site (Admin, Safety, Viewer): devices counted by last valid point, under 5 minutes old
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/occupancy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
